id: pm-review-withdrawn-lineage
title: Keep live finding responses usable after source withdrawal
description: "Fix https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/issues/30 . A verified withdrawn observation must retain lineage evidence without blocking responses and status for live siblings."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T21:57:59.333Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T22:01:53.852Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Fixed/refused canonical and noncanonical source withdrawal preserves live responses and status; Withdrawn evidence remains intact and is reported; Reappearance restores response eligibility and deduplication; Unverified missing sources still refuse and partial imports do not infer withdrawal
parent: pm-review-finding-lineage
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T21:58:16.748Z",codex-agent,"Read issue 30 in full, including its evidence limits and regression criteria; no comments were present. Existing lineage work is merged and remains unchanged. Reproduce the exact two-provider confirmed-lineage scenario in real SDK temporary trackers, then skip only explicitly withdrawn sources and expose their ids in response/status receipts. Keep unverified missing-source failures, test fix/refuse and canonical/noncanonical withdrawal, preserved audit and reappearance. CLI registry remains 2026.10.22; dependency pins stay unchanged. Full npm/Bun release gates will run in CI under the existing shared-host constraint."
  "2026-10-22T21:59:56.798Z",codex-agent,"Baseline reproduction fails with the exact issue error: Recorded verdict thread is missing from the complete PR snapshot. The fix scopes response requirements to non-withdrawn observations and exposes optional withdrawn_items in planner, respond and status receipts. The real tracker matrix covers fix/refuse and canonical/noncanonical withdrawal, including the exact B-only local fix from issue 30, unchanged retained body/reason/commit/comments, live dry-run/application, reappearance and retry deduplication, pending withdrawn exclusion, partial-import behavior and all three missing-source guards. Each test runs with an empty PATH and fenced git discovery; no GitHub or SDK mocks are used for persistence."
  "2026-10-22T22:01:48.097Z",codex-agent,"Verification: pm test pm-review-withdrawn-lineage --run --progress --timeout 600 passed 3/3 linked commands: node --test test/withdrawn-lineage.test.ts (4 passed, 0 failed), npm run typecheck, npm run lint. npm run build:test and npm run build also pass. Documentation gate covers 103 declarations across 30 files; duplication is 0/7338 lines across 49 sources. Three independent scratch-copy function-only reverts from origin/main each exit 1 for node --test --test-name-pattern=\"fix, canonical withdrawn\" test/withdrawn-lineage.test.ts: restoring responsePlan reproduces the original missing-thread raw error; restoring respond fails its withdrawn_items assertion; restoring reviewStatus fails its withdrawn_items assertion. Real SDK tracker persistence is used throughout. Full exact-head npm/Bun release counts and run URL will be recorded in the fix PR. No thresholds changed; no issue closure or release."
